[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah, right.

117
00:10:52,087 --> 00:10:56,008
[SPEAKER_01]: So, the unwholesome action, which is always on you,

118
00:10:58,267 --> 00:11:00,988
[SPEAKER_01]: It starts when you are acting out of that pressure.

119
00:11:03,429 --> 00:11:09,631
[SPEAKER_01]: And it's now important to realize that, in fact, your mind cannot force you to do certain things.

120
