[SPEAKER_01]: And that is eventually how you come to recognize the safety from a wholesome.

122
00:11:18,994 --> 00:11:25,957
[SPEAKER_01]: Because, precisely because it's always up to you, you can develop yourself so as to not give in to the pressure.

123
00:11:26,748 --> 00:11:30,230
[SPEAKER_01]: So that even in the face of pressure, you will not be doing anything unwholesome.

124
00:11:33,191 --> 00:11:37,193
[SPEAKER_01]: Vijaya Prabhupāda often talks about the importance of having that attitude of responsibility.

125
00:11:38,274 --> 00:11:42,456
[SPEAKER_01]: And fundamentally, that is what the right view then boils down to.

126
00:11:43,457 --> 00:11:47,999
