162
00:15:39,774 --> 00:15:43,156
[SPEAKER_01]: And so you turn around and you see, aha, it was basically my mind pressuring me.

163
00:15:43,937 --> 00:15:46,018
[SPEAKER_01]: And that begins with those eight precepts.

164
00:15:46,038 --> 00:15:52,943
[SPEAKER_01]: And then, getting that principle, you want to refine it more and more, so that you see more clearly your mind pressuring you.

165
00:15:53,584 --> 00:15:55,185
[SPEAKER_01]: That's the whole point of those precepts.

166
00:15:56,147 --> 00:16:01,551
[SPEAKER_01]: And that example that you mentioned with that monk who was just not doing anything unwholesome by body, speech and mind.

167
00:16:01,591 --> 00:16:01,811
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah.

168
